{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the Highest Common Divisor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/04358fbfb76e34b53081e6700009efbec14f88d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6432$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/17531b756bc19a5c07c7f1ab8ce1cddf4bb4097c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$132$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is diminished by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, it will equal: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/8093149fca35abe8a41bcfb696526f3073da4355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -6 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/2/d02762de99f15f9c67e3fbe699c3798965d7a1aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(6432, 132)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"111\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de5f84d6f042ffe3ee512feb024729134ca090df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\cdot 12=132$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/8339d4d664409ad681e4eede143c0515f420cb5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6432}{6}=1072\\implies\\frac{1072}{4}=268\\implies\\frac{268}{4}=67$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"365\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87c3e99f3160ed836bdf574519d8ee0cd213d0f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(2^5\\cdot 3\\cdot 67, 2^2\\cdot 3\\cdot 13)=2^2\\cdot 3=12\\implies 12-8=4, \\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"458\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/in